# Optional environment variables
#
# The site builds and runs with none of these set. Copy this file to `.env.local`
# to override the defaults when deploying.

# Canonical origin used for canonical URLs, Open Graph tags, the sitemap and the
# JSON-LD organisation block. Without it the app falls back to the placeholder in
# `src/config/site.ts`, which will not match a real deployment.
#
# Vercel injects VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL at build time; set SITE_URL if you
# deploy elsewhere.
SITE_URL=https://espressly.example.com